---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { profile } from "../../data/profile";
import { externalCases } from "../../data/work";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Work | Eero Siivola"
  description="How Eero Siivola approaches data and AI work, with public industry examples and the experience behind it."
>
  <header class="work-story-hero section-dark">
    <div class="shell work-story-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Work</p>
        <h1>I lead data and AI work from an unclear problem to a working system.</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="work-story-intro">
        A model is only one part. I clarify the decision, assess the data and constraints, build
        and test the system, and connect its output to an owner who can act.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section work-story">
    <div class="shell work-story-grid">
      <p class="kicker">What I bring</p>
      <div class="work-story-body">
        <h2>One coherent approach across the decision, data, model, and delivery.</h2>
        <p class="work-story-lead">
          The hard part is often the interaction between disciplines. I move between statistical
          judgement, software architecture, process design, and technical leadership without
          losing sight of the outcome.
        </p>
        <p>
          I combine more than ten years in machine learning and a doctorate with more than five
          years leading projects from planning to delivery. Three years managing a ten-person
          multidisciplinary team strengthened the other half of the work: setting direction,
          explaining trade-offs, and keeping specialists aligned.
        </p>
        <div class="work-story-links">
          <a class="text-link" href="/about/">Experience and roles</a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/research/">Research and open source</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section work-case-story">
    <div class="shell work-case-grid">
      <p class="kicker">Public cases · Vuono Group</p>
      <div class="work-case-list">
        {
          externalCases.map((item) => (
            <article>
              <p class="article-meta">{item.date}</p>
              <h2>{item.title}</h2>
              <p>{item.summary}</p>
              <p>{item.body}</p>
              <a class="text-link" href={item.href}>
                Read the public case at Vuono Group
              </a>
            </article>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="work-story-contact">
    <div class="shell work-story-contact-inner">
      <p>I currently work as a Senior Data Scientist at Vuono Group.</p>
      <a class="button button-accent" href={profile.social.linkedin}>
        Discuss a data or AI challenge
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
